{"channelId":"UCtlliEe122gT7xb_CzNyxXg","row":["Chesterfield Animal Rescue",19,"Here at Chesterfield Animal Rescue we are a no-kill, non-profit organisation founded in July 2012 by a team of animal lovers dedicated to saving the lives of as many dogs and cats as possible each year. We rely on donations to continue saving lives, we are fundraising to buy our own centre, something that will enable us to help thousands more animals over the years. We currently use foster homes and kennels for our dogs and cats, we are always in need of more foster homes as well as kennel sponsors.","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtlliEe122gT7xb_CzNyxXg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtlliEe122gT7xb_CzNyxXg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:33.397Z","channelId":"UCtlliEe122gT7xb_CzNyxXg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"059da4b73150f7326684fe9f2a876e7e3e8a16c0afc724b55776b70f6d0039ba","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7f034fa62d7309149a8fa9591bab9a8241dc975436d5ac6b706b758644900334"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtlliEe122gT7xb_CzNyxXg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:33.397Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtlliEe122gT7xb_CzNyxXg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":19,"raw":"19 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtlliEe122gT7xb_CzNyxXg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:33.397Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"organization_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtlliEe122gT7xb_CzNyxXg"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；职业资质仍未核验。","keywords":["animal rescue"],"role":"organizatio